Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Package: edemint-base
Version: 0.1
Maintainer: Edemint <hello@edemint.invalid>
Homepage: https://example.invalid/edemint
Architecture: all
Depends: @DEPS@
Description: Edemint base metapackage — system plumbing
 The Edemint base metapackage pulls in everything a complete Edemint OS
 needs below the desktop: firmware (non-free-firmware), CPU microcode,
 NetworkManager + ModemManager, BlueZ, CUPS + Avahi, power-profiles-daemon,
 storage tools (ntfs-3g/exfat/btrfs/LVM/cryptsetup), audio (PipeWire +
 WirePlumber), zram + earlyoom, AppArmor + nftables + unattended-upgrades,
 gnome-keyring, fprintd. Installing this metapackage on a vanilla Debian
 Trixie box reproduces the Edemint base.
